{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/extras/1d2e81c06770b2001f503309766c92d6.poster.avif?t=1758843431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/extras/1d2e81c06770b2001f503309766c92d6.gif?t=1758843431\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molitva</strong> \u2013 a brutal, nonlinear visual novel about sins committed and the final chance for redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the moment of suicide, when despair overwhelms the soul, a plea for forgiveness is heard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And God responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance granted from above \u2014 three days in the Borderland, a fragile world where it is still possible to find a path to liberation from sin. Here, the past comes to life, and each choice brings one closer either to salvation or to final oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/extras/b2cf56d48c5d885a02e5109ad5631392.avif?t=1758843431\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the past leaves you as nothing more than fertilizer for graveyard weeds, there remains only one question: Are you worthy of forgiveness?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576940?t=1758843431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/f95cbe4b6d4774d268f8ca61614f937dcdbbb8f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758843431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576940/ab410bfb2cab520afec9eca54beb7635594676d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758843431","capsule_imagev5